@startuml uc003-ssd
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-003 Execute target model: system sequence diagram

actor Developer
participant "JudgeLab" as System
actor "Target model" as Target

note over Developer, System
  Triggered inside a run (UC-006), with a loaded
  benchmark (UC-002) and a target connection (UC-001).
end note

loop for each test case, in benchmark order
  alt the run has not been stopped
    System -> Target : question
    alt the target replies (an answer, a refusal or a cut-off answer)
      Target --> System : model response
      System -> System : record result(case, model response)
    else 2a: a connector error (unavailable, rate limit, ...)
      Target --> System : error
      System -> System : record result(case, connector error)
    else 2b: an auth or quota error
      Target --> System : error
      System -> System : record result(case, connector error)\nand stop the run
    end
  else the run was stopped by an earlier case
    System -> System : record result(case, "not sent: run stopped after ...")
  end
  System --> Developer : case executed (progress)
end

System --> Developer : one result per case, in benchmark order (judged in UC-004)
@enduml
